{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"松自然变换"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"松自然变换"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>松自然变换是 $2$-范畴 (或更高阶范畴) 之间的函子之间的一种态射, 是自然变换的推广.</p>\n<p>松自然变换也可视为一种"},{"Local":{"url":"松态射","text":"松态射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"2-范畴","text":"$2$-范畴"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n"}]}}